One-Handed Fedora Remix: licensing
==================================

This repository uses two licenses for its own work, plus one for files taken
from LazyVim.

1. Code and configuration: MIT License (LICENSES/MIT.txt)
   Copyright (c) 2026 luzikaj and contributors
   - scripts: fedora-setup.sh, build-spin.sh, files/bin/*, files/jetbrains/*,
     tools/**, update/**, .github/**, docs/learn/trainer.html
   - kickstarts: niri-spin-base.ks, branding.ks
   - configs: everything else under files/ (keymaps, niri, keyd, xkb, fish,
     ghostty, foot, vimium, zed, k9s, virt, welcome, nvim except below)

2. Documentation and artwork: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
   International (LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt)
   Copyright (c) 2026 luzikaj and contributors
   - *.md (README, BUILDING, DIFFERENCES, CHANGELOG, docs/)
   - files/wallpapers/*, files/branding/* (logo, wordmark), files/docs/*.pdf,
     docs/learn/cheat-sheets.pdf

3. From the LazyVim starter (https://github.com/LazyVim/starter):
   Apache License 2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt), unchanged copies of
   - files/nvim/init.lua
   - files/nvim/lua/config/lazy.lua

Trademarks: "Fedora" and the Fedora logo are trademarks of Red Hat, Inc. This
